# Academic honesty

This is still a Duke Kunshan Signature Work. Cursor may **design and build the software** from the student's vision without treating every architecture choice as a stop-the-line confirmation.

The student still owns:

- what the work is claiming
- interpretation of experimental results
- thesis conclusions

## Never

- fabricate experimental results or benchmark scores
- fabricate citations or papers
- invent evidence
- present assumptions as established facts
- generate conclusions before experiments are run

Building, redesigning, and expanding the software is allowed. Faking the evaluation story is not.
